# NOTE: source-documents/ is a submodule pointing at the private repo
# Yashas120/personal-site-reference (CV, resume, credential evaluation,
# teaching artifacts). It must NOT be listed here — git cannot track a
# submodule at an ignored path. The submodule boundary is what keeps those
# documents out of this repository; only a URL and a commit SHA are stored.
